{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的部分段落感受词出现得过密，尤其 S03、S06、S11、S13，短时间内连续跟读容易顾不上听音乐；X 的左右分栏更容易快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的左右分栏简洁，扫读效率更高，但右侧不少感受词只是概括情绪，音乐变化与人物心理之间的对应关系不够充分。Y 用重点高亮帮助观众抓住每段叙事转折，又通过分时出现的感受词呈现情绪变化、音乐动作和人物记忆之间的联系，尤其在 S03、S06、S09、S11、S13，人物为什么矛盾、如何反复、最后怎样改变，都更容易理解。整体而言，Y 虽然牺牲了一些扫读轻松度，却在叙事理解、前后连贯和感受细腻度上提供了更多实际收获。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1b8db707-38e1-44d4-b7a1-f9b4916333c8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010857783248Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:09:42.497124+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "904006a020006b79556175e22fe58ab09d93b41d1dc6ce4c68dc36acaadc731b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222